SUMMARY:Shows on Ice! Halloween Edition: Dracula on Ice
LOCATION:BLOCK42 at NUANU\, Beraban\, Kediri\, Tabanan
DESCRIPTION:Dracula on Ice — Halloween Edition at BLOCK42\, Nuanu This Ha
 lloween\, BLOCK42\, Nuanu transforms into a dark and spectacular world of 
 ice\, theatre and mystery. Dracula on Ice brings the legendary story to li
 fe through professional figure skating\, dramatic choreography\, circus pe
 rformance\, theatrical effects and immersive visual projections — all pe
 rformed on a real ice rink in the heart of Bali. Expect powerful skating\,
  breathtaking jumps and spins\, acrobatics\, striking costumes\, atmospher
 ic lighting and a gothic world where elegance meets danger. Come in costum
 e and receive 1 complimentary welcome drink + 1 themed Halloween snack. Fo
 r Halloween weekend\, Dracula on Ice will be presented in two different ex
 periences: 31 OCTOBER\, 22:00 DRACULA ON ICE: HALLOWEEN NIGHT followed by 
 THE AFTERLIFE PARTY A darker late-night Halloween experience. A darker and
  more intense edition of the show\, created primarily for an adult audienc
 e. Expect a stronger Halloween atmosphere\, dramatic theatrical moments\, 
 gothic visuals and a more mysterious and provocative interpretation of the
  Dracula story. Recommended for ages 16+. 31 OCTOBER\, 23:30 THE AFTERLIFE
  PARTY The night doesn’t end when the ice melts. As Dracula on Ice: Hall
 oween Night reaches its finale\, BLOCK42 transforms from theatre into a fu
 ll-scale Halloween party. The lights change. The music gets louder. The da
 nce floor comes alive. Expect DJs\, immersive lighting\, special effects\,
  Halloween characters\, costumes\, performances and surprises throughout t
 he night — all inside the transformed world of Dracula. And this Hallowe
 en\, the ice remains part of the experience. HALLOWEEN SKATE Step onto the
  ice yourself during special Halloween Skate sessions and experience the r
 ink under club lights\, music and Halloween visuals. Skating sessions will
  operate with limited capacity throughout the night. Skate access and skat
 e rental may be available as a separate ticket add-on\, subject to availab
 ility. Watch the show. Enter the party. Step onto the ice. Come for Dracul
 a on Ice. Stay for The Afterlife Party. A real Halloween celebration — d
 arker\, louder and scarier after midnight. Costumes are highly encouraged.
  Bring your own ice skates or rent a pair at the venue\, subject to availa
 bility. One legend. Two nights. Two different experiences. A unique Hallow
 een event at BLOCK42\, Nuanu\, bringing together figure skating\, theatre\
 , circus performance\, immersive visuals\, music and a full-scale Hallowee
 n celebration on and around the ice. How to Choose Your Show and Seats The
  two performances take place on different dates and at different session t
 imes\, and each session offers a different version of Dracula on Ice. Plea
 se select your preferred session when purchasing your ticket: 31 October 2
 026 at 22:00 — DRACULA ON ICE: HALLOWEEN NIGHT followed by — THE AFTER
 LIFE PARTY After selecting your session\, you can use the venue seating pl
 an to choose your preferred seating area and available seats. Please check
  the show version\, date and session time carefully before completing your
  booking\, as the atmosphere and format of the two performances are differ
 ent. The SEATING PLAN Age Recommendation This event is recommended for gue
 sts aged 16 and above. Rekomendasi Usia Acara ini direkomendasikan untuk p
 enonton berusia 16 tahun ke atas. The Venue BLOCK42\, Nuanu\, Bali\, Indon
 esia - Inside Nuanu Creative City BLOCK42 is located in Nuanu\, the creati
 ve city on Bali’s west coast. Please check the event page for the exact 
 venue location\, entrance details and directions. - A purpose-built ice ar
 ena The venue features a specially installed ice rink together with a full
 -scale production setup including professional lighting\, sound and large-
 format video projection — creating a complete theatrical ice-show experi
 ence. - Doors open 1 hour before the show We recommend arriving early to a
 llow enough time for entry and seating. Latecomers may be admitted during 
 a suitable pause in the performance to avoid disturbing the audience. - Pa
 rki\n\nMore info: https://baligasm.com/event/block42-at-nuanu-dracula-on-i
 ce-halloween-oct-2026\n\nPlease verify with the organizer before attending
